      <slug></slug>
      <title>The Document Foundation</title>
      <subtitle>four months in the making</subtitle>
      <track>LibreOffice devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Come and hear what we&amp;#39;ve been up to, and where we&amp;#39;re going.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;On the 26th of September 2010 the birth of the LibreOffice project was announced. Ever since that time, the project has grown in size, contributors, infrastructure, etc. It will be a both a retrospective of what we started with as a team, what we accomplished and where we&amp;#39;re heading in terms of project and vision.&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
